{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The second installment in the series\u2014now bigger and better than ever!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each minigame lasts around 2\u20133 minutes. Packed with fast-paced competitive and cooperative challenges that anyone can enjoy with intuitive controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports local multiplayer and co-op, plus Remote Play Together. Jump in and have instant fun\u2014even with friends far away!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Free Mode]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788460/extras/aaf5ada03e1ab2bc8e9056a57d838c13.poster.avif?t=1771464227\" width=1170 height=524 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788460/extras/aaf5ada03e1ab2bc8e9056a57d838c13.webm?t=1771464227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788460/extras/aaf5ada03e1ab2bc8e9056a57d838c13.mp4?t=1771464227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your favorite game and play right away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy an additional selection of co-op games where you must work together to succeed!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Party Mode]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose games to play in succession and compete to be the Party Champion! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own characters and invite them to the party to play along! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Character Edit]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788460/extras/f9cfdfe5fb08b59567c44deef6e5fe7f.poster.avif?t=1771464227\" width=1170 height=524 ><source src=\"h